.TH "libnvme" 9 "enum nvmf_auth_rcodeex" "October 2026" "API Manual" LINUX
.SH NAME
enum nvmf_auth_rcodeex \- AUTH_Failure Reason Code Explanations (RCODEEX)
.SH SYNOPSIS
enum nvmf_auth_rcodeex {
.br
.BI "    NVMF_AUTH_RCODEEX_FAILED"
, 
.br
.br
.BI "    NVMF_AUTH_RCODEEX_PROTOCOL_NOT_USABLE"
, 
.br
.br
.BI "    NVMF_AUTH_RCODEEX_SCC_MISMATCH"
, 
.br
.br
.BI "    NVMF_AUTH_RCODEEX_HASH_NOT_USABLE"
, 
.br
.br
.BI "    NVMF_AUTH_RCODEEX_KXGROUP_NOT_USABLE"
, 
.br
.br
.BI "    NVMF_AUTH_RCODEEX_INCORRECT_PAYLOAD"
, 
.br
.br
.BI "    NVMF_AUTH_RCODEEX_INCORRECT_MESSAGE"

};
.SH Constants
.IP "NVMF_AUTH_RCODEEX_FAILED" 12
Authentication failed:
authentication of the involved host or NVM subsystem failed
.IP "NVMF_AUTH_RCODEEX_PROTOCOL_NOT_USABLE" 12
Authentication protocol not
usable: the protocol descriptors proposed by the host do not
satisfy the security requirements of the controller
.IP "NVMF_AUTH_RCODEEX_SCC_MISMATCH" 12
Secure channel concatenation
mismatch: the SC_C value specified by the host does not
satisfy the security requirements of the controller
.IP "NVMF_AUTH_RCODEEX_HASH_NOT_USABLE" 12
Hash function not usable: the
HashIDList proposed by the host does not satisfy the security
requirements of the controller
.IP "NVMF_AUTH_RCODEEX_KXGROUP_NOT_USABLE" 12
Key exchange group not usable:
the KXgIDList proposed by the host does not satisfy the
security requirements of the controller
.IP "NVMF_AUTH_RCODEEX_INCORRECT_PAYLOAD" 12
Incorrect payload: the payload
of the received message is not correct
.IP "NVMF_AUTH_RCODEEX_INCORRECT_MESSAGE" 12
Incorrect protocol message: the
received message is not the expected next message in the
authentication protocol sequence
